[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5090144237","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121741#issuecomment-5090144237","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121741","id":5090144237,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABL2Vv7Q","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-27T10:21:34Z","updated_at":"2026-07-27T10:21:34Z","body":"Not sure what is expected here, does it change if the value is actually used? This is a line that has no actual effect so might not be anything there to preview until the next actually meaningful statement","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5090144237/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5090304932","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121741#issuecomment-5090304932","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121741","id":5090304932,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABL2fjpA","user":{"login":"Arecher","id":10502115,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTAyMTE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10502115?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher","html_url":"https://github.com/Arecher","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-27T10:39:20Z","updated_at":"2026-07-27T11:07:36Z","body":"Whether the value is used shouldn't matter. A shader preview just previews whatever assignment is happening on that line, no matter whether it is used or applied to any of the built-ins (say ALBEDO). In this case, a value of 0.0 should be a completely black square, while a value of 1.0 would show a white square. It essentially represents the data as a `vec3()`/ `vec4()`.\n\nThe issue is that it doesn't only show the assignment on that line, but also shows data/effects that have already been set to the material.\n\nAt least, that's how it works for any assignment that happens before `NORMAL_MAP` or `ROUGHNESS` etc are set. Whether Shader Previews are actually implemented to **only** show the assignment on that line, or whether they simply **overwrite the albedo** of the material preview and display that isn't clear or documented anywhere. But my presumption is that it is meant to show **only** the assignment, because that is the most accurate (and therefore most useful for debugging) view it can display. \n\nRight now it sometimes outputs a preview that is neither a perfect representation of the assignment, nor a perfect representation of the state of the output material at that line, but rather a amalgamation of both.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5090304932/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5090346964","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121741#issuecomment-5090346964","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121741","id":5090346964,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABL2iH1A","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-27T10:44:16Z","updated_at":"2026-07-27T10:44:16Z","body":"I think that the shader preview is meant to be a kind of breakpoint, but not sure what is the intention here, and I don't know that that would be the expected behavior generally, but will see what the team says! Would be relevant to evaluate what happens if the code isn't dead code though","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5090346964/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5090370860","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121741#issuecomment-5090370860","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121741","id":5090370860,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABL2jlLA","user":{"login":"Arecher","id":10502115,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTAyMTE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10502115?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher","html_url":"https://github.com/Arecher","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-27T10:47:02Z","updated_at":"2026-07-27T11:09:19Z","bod