"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5090393076/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5090437520","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121741#issuecomment-5090437520","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121741","id":5090437520,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABL2npkA","user":{"login":"Arecher","id":10502115,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTAyMTE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10502115?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher","html_url":"https://github.com/Arecher","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-27T10:54:57Z","updated_at":"2026-07-27T11:09:08Z","body":"<img width=\"1055\" height=\"862\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/03bdc269-4962-450d-867a-8bbd7f2a8a9c\" />\n\n<img width=\"1028\" height=\"890\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/77b7b388-3aae-4edb-babf-6e708153a680\" />\n\nIt results in the same effect!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5090437520/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"resolved"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5090476989","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121741#issuecomment-5090476989","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121741","id":5090476989,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABL2qDvQ","user":{"login":"Arecher","id":10502115,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTAyMTE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10502115?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher","html_url":"https://github.com/Arecher","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-27T10:59:24Z","updated_at":"2026-07-27T11:13:58Z","body":"I do think there is a benefit to being able to see what the output of all the combined, already set built-in values is, but I would not expect it to happen on unrelated assignments. Perhaps when specifically previewing the line that sets `NORMAL_MAP`/any other built-in, the default behaviour could be that it shows the material at its current breakpoint. But since previewing a line before *any* ALBEDO assignment has happened does not show a completely transparent/black square, it does not **only** breakpoint the material at the very least.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5090476989/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5090491994","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121741#issuecomment-5090491994","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121741","id":5090491994,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABL2q-Wg","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-27T11:00:43Z","updated_at":"2026-07-27T11:00:43Z","body":"You're still previewing dead code but probably not relevant","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5090491994/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5090518753","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121741#issuecomment-5090518753","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121741","id":5090518753,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABL2sm4Q","user":{"login":"Arecher","id":10502115,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTAyMTE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10502115?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher","html_url":"https://github.com/Arecher","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-27T11:03:48Z","updated_at":"2026-07-27T11:03:48Z","body":"Right, you're saying it might be important the value is used *after* the preview, not that it needs to be used somewhere in the shader. Sorry, I misunderstood.\n\n<img width=\"938\" height=\"621\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8ec596ee-65a0-4b7c-a359-43785add53c9\" />","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5090518753/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5103342894","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121741#issuecomment-5103342894","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121741","id":5103342894,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABMC7VLg","user":{"login":"cashew-olddew","id":155181921,"node_id":"U_kgDOCT_jYQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/155181921?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cashew-olddew","html_url":"https://github.com/cashew-olddew","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cashew-olddew/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cashew-olddew/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cashew-olddew/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cashew-olddew/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cashew-olddew/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cashew-olddew/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cashew-olddew/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cashew-olddew/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cashew-olddew/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-28T11:08:57Z","updated_at":"2026-07-28T11:10:47Z","body":"What the shader previewer does behind the scenes is to take all code up until the breakpoint and insert a COLOR/ALBEDO assignment instead of the rest of the code.\n\nThis still leaves all other Built-ins modified. If you had previously set the NORMAL_MAP, or any other built-in, they'll still hold the values you assigned, leading to the result in your first example.\n\nWhen I created the addon on which this feature is based, the intention behind it was to show how the shader looks if you were to reach that line and set the COLOR to its value. So this works as intended, or, to be more precise, as _I_ intended. This doesn't necessarily mean it's the correct way, it's just a different way of interpreting what the previewer should do.\n\nThinking of it in retrospective, there are cases in which it would make more sense to have the option to replace all Built-ins to their defaults.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5103342894/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]